new file mode 100644
index 0000000..3f28880
--- /dev/null
+++ b/changelog/7220.bugfix.rst
@@ -0,0 +1,4 @@
+Fixed the reported path of a failing test being made relative to the current
+working directory, which could change during the test run (for example when a
+fixture changes directory). Paths are now shown relative to the directory
+pytest was invoked from.
